  "sections": [
    {
      "tag": "HEADER",
      "id": "",
      "cls": "pointer-events-none fixed inset-x-0 top-0 z-50",
      "y": 0,
      "h": 80,
      "text": "Models Pricing Verification Docs Change language Toggle theme Sign in Get your key",
      "bg": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)"
    },
    {
      "tag": "SECTION",
      "id": "",
      "cls": "relative z-10 px-4 pt-20 pb-4 md:px-6 md:pt-24 md:pb-6",
      "y": 0,
      "h": 696,
      "text": "The model you pay for. From a verified provider. Sterling sends every request to a provider Mira Network has tested, so the model you pay for is the one that answers. See provider scores Get your key Three steps. Then the verified model. Create your key, get credits, and route through a verified provider. STEP 01 Create your key One key for Claude, GPT, Gemini and more. STEP 02 Add credit USDC or ",
      "bg": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)"
    },
    {
      "tag": "SECTION",
      "id": "",
      "cls": "relative z-10 px-6 py-14 md:py-20",
      "y": 696,
      "h": 864,
      "text": "Routed only to providers that are verified. A model name on an API is a claim. Mira Network tests every provider behind Sterling on a schedule and publishes the result per model-provider pair, with the request and response behind each verdict. See Verification scores Model identity The provider's outputs are compared with a reference snapshot of the model it says it serves, across repeated runs. T",
      "bg": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)"
    },
    {
      "tag": "SECTION",
      "id": "",
      "cls": "relative z-10 px-6 py-12 md:py-16",
      "y": 1560,
      "h": 592,
      "text": "Three steps. Then you're in. 01 Create your key. One key for every model on Sterling. 02 Add credit. Top up in USDC or MIRA, then pay as you go. 03 Plug into your app. Change the base URL. Keep your code.",
      "bg": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)"
    },
    {
      "tag": "SECTION",
      "id": "",
      "cls": "relative z-10 px-6 py-12 md:py-16",
      "y": 2152,
      "h": 703,
      "text": "Change the endpoint. Keep your workflow. curl Copy code curl https://sterling.mira.network/v1/chat/completions \\ -H \"Authorization: Bearer $STERLING_API_KEY\" \\ -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\ -d '{ \"model\": \"claude-sonnet-5-5\", \"messages\": [{\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"Hello\"}] }' OpenAI-compatible. Read the quickstart",
      "bg": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)"
    },
    {
      "tag": "SECTION",
      "id": "",
      "cls": "relative z-10 px-6 py-12 md:py-20",
